---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects | Bryce Mason">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="page-head">
      <p class="mini-label">Projects</p>
      <h1>Selected work, research, and writing.</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A growing collection of research, presentations, and ideas. Some pieces
        are complete, and others are still being built out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="projects-grid">
      <article class="project-card">
        <p class="tag">Research</p>
        <h2>Offshore Wind Farms and Fishing Activity in the Irish Sea</h2>
        <p>
          This research poster examines how offshore wind farm operation affects
          fishing activity in the Irish Sea. Using AIS-based fishing effort data
          and a difference-in-differences approach, I compare wind farm areas to
          nearby control waters before and after operation begins. The results
          suggest lower fishing effort within treated wind farm polygons and
          point to more localized shifts in fishing behavior rather than clear
          industry-wide losses.
        </p>
        <p class="project-link">
          <a href="/offshore-wind-poster.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            View Poster (PDF)
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <p class="tag">Professional Work</p>
        <h2>G3 Enterprises Final Internship Presentation</h2>
        <p>
          Final presentation from my Finance and Sales Operations internship at
          G3 Enterprises, covering work tied to analytics, reporting, CRM
          optimization, and broader business support.
        </p>
        <p class="project-link">
          <a href="/BryceMasonInternPresentation.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            View Presentation (PDF)
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <p class="tag">Writing</p>
        <h2>Writing &amp; Notes</h2>
        <p>
          Short analytical essays on finance, markets, investing, and climate
          as I continue learning and building my perspective.
        </p>
        <p class="project-link">
          <a href="/writing">Open Writing</a>
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card">
        <p class="tag">Tooling</p>
        <h2>Startup Sourcing &amp; Market Mapping Tool</h2>
        <p>
          A Python-based tool for automated startup sourcing and market mapping.
          It scrapes company data, generates structured profiles, tags each
          company by sector and business model, and scores companies against a
          configurable investment thesis.
        </p>
        <p class="status">Under construction.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-head {
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .mini-label {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #a9c2af;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #c8cfcc;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
  }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .project-card {
    background: #1c1f22;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e33;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #2c3a31;
    color: #a9c2af;
    border: 1px solid #3b4c40;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .project-card p {
    color: #c8cfcc;
  }

  .project-link a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #2c3a31;
    color: #e8efe9;
    border: 1px solid #3b4c40;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .status {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: #a9c2af;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .project-card {
      padding: 22px 20px;
      border-radius: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>